{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:81a67d0a64985b62","name":"Fugitive Commander Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-81a67d0a64985b62","title":"Fugitive Commander Talent Tree","revision":20161,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:19:52Z","sha256":"6fddd76c387ea41576077ed465bc0c261af1ef5befa58339cab8599d7b93cd33","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20161","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Fugitive%20Commander%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-81a67d0a64985b62","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When a fighting force is outmanned, outgunned, and constantly on the run, only the skill and acumen of talented ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officers"}," can keep morale high and prevent desertion or surrender. Fugitive Commanders are skilled in the art of deceiving and eluding their pursuers.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Disciplined Trickery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you allow one ally within 12 squares of you and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to reroll one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check, but the ally must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Group Perception"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you roll a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check, all allies within 6 squares of you can do so as well, taking the highest result rolled by you or an ally.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hasty Withdrawal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn, you target a number of allies equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," bonus (minimum 1). Each targeted ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". Each ally you target can take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraw","referenceId":"reference:164546a9c5481480"}," Action immediately as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},". The normal rules for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdrawing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdrawing"}," otherwise apply.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stalwart Subordinates"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When any ally within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," is targeted by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," against its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", the source of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," (whether a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hazard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hazard"},", a creature, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", or whatever) must roll the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," twice, and take the lowest result.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stay in the Fight"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Stalwart Subordinates"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you remove one Mind-Affecting or Fear effect currently affecting an ally within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". When you do so, you also grant the target a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to 10 + your Class Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stealthy Withdrawal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Hasty Withdrawal"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When an ally ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraws"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraws"}," as a result of your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Hasty Withdrawal"]}," Talent and ends its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraw","referenceId":"reference:164546a9c5481480"}," Action with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from any enemy target, that ally can make an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sneak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sneak"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
